      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 151, 153, 154]\n    volumes = [200, 220, 210, 230, 240]\n\n    # Calculate OBV, starting from zero\n    obv = 0\n    for i in range(1, len(closing_prices)):\n        if closing_prices[i] > closing_prices[i - 1]:\n            obv += volumes[i]\n        elif closing_prices[i] < closing_prices[i - 1]:\n            obv -= volumes[i]\n\n    # Return the OBV on the fifth day in thousands of shares\n    return obv\n```",
